OL,3,AAndrew takes legal action over search
OL,4,Awarrants before his arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor is taking
OL,7,Flegal action against Thames Valley
OL,8,FPolice over search warrants issued
OL,9,Fbefore his arrest in February.
OL,11,FThe former Prince Andrew was arrested
OL,12,Fon suspicion of misconduct in public
OL,13,Foffice, in the wake of information that
OL,14,Femerged from the Epstein files in the
OL,15,FUnited States. Mountbatten-Windsor has
OL,16,Fconsistently denied any wrongdoing
OL,17,Flinked to his association with Epstein.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
