OL,3,AAndrew takes legal action over search
OL,4,Awarrants before his arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis lawyers are understood to be
OL,7,Fchallenging the lawfulness of search
OL,8,Fwarrants used for Sandringham and at
OL,9,FRoyal Lodge in Windsor relating to his
OL,10,Farrest, as first reported by the
OL,11,FTelegraph.
OL,13,FA royal source has made clear that
OL,14,Fwhile the King provides a private
OL,15,Fallowance for Mountbatten-Windsor, this
OL,16,Fmoney is not to be used to fund such a
OL,17,Fjudicial review.
